{"h":3395,"w":2400,"lines":[{"x":0.81069958806051867,"w":0.0576131693522135,"y":0.097383720787522332,"c":1,"t":"Test 3","h":0.013081395583944611},{"w":0.55144032796223952,"x":0.17695473302875675,"y":0.14244186035829842,"h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1,"t":"Now I should explain that the road isn't completely closed to cars. But only"},{"t":"residents' cars are allowed. If people really need to get in or out of Beechwood","h":0.013250883392226132,"y":0.15547703169500116,"c":1,"w":0.58230453491210932,"x":0.17695472833905987},{"y":0.17137809204018672,"w":0.5884773763020833,"h":0.013250883392226132,"t":"Road, it's not a problem - as long as they drive at under 20 kilometres per hour.","x":0.17901234054736667,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"But most people just decide not to use their cars during this time, or they park in","x":0.1790123487143461,"w":0.59053497314453118,"y":0.18604651152136031,"h":0.011627907185728703},{"t":"another street. The wardens are only there to stop through traffic.","x":0.17695472613241742,"w":0.48559672037760421,"c":1,"h":0.011778563015312105,"y":0.20053003555500548},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"w":0.47530863444010418,"t":"PRESENTER: So can anyone apply to get involved in Street Play?","c":1,"x":0.086419758034123689,"y":0.21366279054164594},{"w":0.041152264277140305,"h":0.008720930389296444,"y":0.23110465106147171,"c":1,"t":"ALICE:","x":0.086419752537626515},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"t":"Absolutely - we want to include all kids in the city - especially those who live on","x":0.17695472643555954,"y":0.22965116268405217,"w":0.59465021769205728},{"t":"busy roads. It's here that demand is greatest. Obviously, there isn't such demand","y":0.24411071849034593,"w":0.60082305908203115,"x":0.17695472550049013,"h":0.011778563015312216,"c":1},{"y":0.25872093012582975,"w":0.59876541137695316,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"t":"in wealthier areas where the children have access to parks or large gardens - or","x":0.176954742756047},{"c":1,"t":"in the suburbs where there are usually more places for children to play outside.","x":0.17695474000523764,"y":0.27179034141255032,"h":0.013093378855567051,"w":0.59053497314453129},{"h":0.014529378169838236,"t":"I'd recommend that anyone listening who likes the idea should just give it a go.","w":0.58448481241861971,"y":0.29217306116517494,"c":1,"x":0.17690105643276308},{"y":0.30800942280890831,"c":1,"t":"We've been surprised by the positive reaction of residents all over the city. And","x":0.17901234149492742,"w":0.58230453491210943,"h":0.013250883392226021},{"t":"that's not just parents. There are always a few who complain but they're a tiny","x":0.17483537677603919,"y":0.32258119778155014,"h":0.014655507495462294,"c":1,"w":0.58037073771158854},{"h":0.014723203769140047,"t":"minority. On the whole everyone is very supportive and say they're very happy to","x":0.17489712866306312,"y":0.33716136629753657,"w":0.60493825276692714,"c":1},{"w":0.45902745564778646,"h":0.0162507799685494,"t":"see children out on the street - even if it does get quite noisy.","y":0.35051855320151581,"x":0.17482278758402117,"c":1},{"w":0.043209877014160139,"h":0.010174418787512574,"y":0.3895348836027247,"c":1,"t":"ALICE:","x":0.084362139590169208},{"t":"There have been so many benefits of Street Play for the kids. Parents really like the","h":0.01453488398216074,"y":0.38808139521568974,"x":0.17695472549834429,"w":0.60082305908203115,"c":1},{"y":0.40253239097942206,"t":"fact that the kids are getting fresh air instead of sitting staring at a computer screen,","x":0.17489712044966646,"h":0.014723203769140047,"c":1,"w":0.60288065592447926},{"x":0.17695472550365726,"t":"even if they're not doing anything particularly energetic. And of course it's great that","c":1,"y":0.41715116265731922,"w":0.60082305908203115,"h":0.014534883982160629},{"w":0.59053497314453129,"t":"kids can play with their friends outside without being supervised by their parents -","h":0.01453659587810685,"x":0.17695473552692856,"y":0.43168433448203847,"c":1},{"w":0.5884773763020833,"y":0.44611307392820532,"t":"but for me the biggest advantage is that kids develop confidence in themselves to","x":0.17695472737661666,"h":0.013250883392226021,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.46075581383339947,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"be outside without their parents. The other really fantastic thing is that children get","x":0.17489711328407945,"w":0.59465021769205728},{"h":0.013250883392226243,"y":0.47526501742998883,"w":0.5041152445475261,"c":1,"t":"to know the adults in the street- it's like having a big extended family.","x":0.17489711013061851},{"h":0.008720930389296444,"x":0.086419752080884399,"c":1,"t":"PRESENTER:","y":0.49127906967759782,"w":0.082304528554280582},{"y":0.48969375743796628,"t":"It certainly does have a lot of benefits. I want to move on now and ask you about","w":0.60082305908203126,"c":1,"h":0.011778563015312105,"x":0.17695472550013666},{"y":0.50436046499084497,"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.17695473479314691,"w":0.23456789652506507,"c":1,"t":"a related project in King Street."},{"h":0.010174418787512574,"w":0.043209877014160167,"y":0.52034883709243551,"x":0.0843621395844837,"c":1,"t":"ALICE:"},{"x":0.17695472486774746,"y":0.51884570092641658,"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1,"t":"Right. Well this was an experiment I was involved in where local residents","w":0.54938273111979175},{"x":0.17689614767041878,"t":"decided to try and reduce the traffic along King Street, which is the busiest main","y":0.53193024629100194,"w":0.59681528727213551,"h":0.015600346002477727,"c":1},{"t":"road in our area, by persuading people not to use their cars for one day. We","c":1,"y":0.54644162844571764,"x":0.17690560043987583,"w":0.56389236450195312,"h":0.014651509701714249},{"h":0.011778563015312105,"c":1,"t":"thought about making people pay more for parking - but we decided that would","x":0.17901234055266202,"w":0.5884773763020833,"y":0.56242638387462918},{"c":1,"y":0.57558139519684715,"x":0.17695472995159273,"w":0.57613169352213545,"t":"be really unpopular - so instead we just stopped people from parking on King","h":0.01453488398216074},{"y":0.59156976733315525,"w":0.29423868815104165,"t":"Street but left the other car parks open.","h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"x":0.17901234306216035},{"w":0.58436213175455731,"t":"It was surprising how much of a difference all this made. As we'd predicted, air","h":0.014723203769140158,"x":0.17695473670745343,"y":0.60453474698783705,"c":1},{"w":0.59876541137695316,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"t":"quality was significantly better but what I hadn't expected was how much quieter","x":0.17695474277200096,"y":0.62063953476382283},{"x":0.17489712974656166,"w":0.59876541137695316,"h":0.014569123586018917,"c":1,"y":0.63368669049197768,"t":"it would be - even with the buses still running. Of course everyone said they felt"},{"y":0.64958775029220883,"w":0.59876541137695316,"x":0.17695474276866832,"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1,"t":"safer but we were actually amazed that sales in the shops went up considerably"},{"w":0.53292180379231779,"t":"that day - we thought there'd be fewer people out shopping - not more.","x":0.1790123484124832,"h":0.013081394460653373,"c":1,"y":0.66279069790048717},{"c":1,"t":"PRESENTER: That's really interesting so the fact that...","x":0.088477363978351778,"w":0.40329218546549478,"h":0.013101939458588729,"y":0.68021201414259735},{"x":0.81069958908776962,"t":"Q14","y":0.17005813937372527,"w":0.037037035624186254,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"x":0.81275720202735313,"y":0.22819767426017146,"w":0.034979422887166267,"t":"Q15"},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.81275720204021318,"w":0.034979422887166378,"t":"Q16","c":1,"y":0.33720930218475198},{"t":"Q17IQ18","x":0.79423868263223285,"w":0.072016461690266764,"h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.44622093011044783,"c":1},{"t":"Q17IQ18","x":0.79423868193778846,"h":0.013081394460653484,"w":0.072016461690266875,"c":1,"y":0.45930232586196984},{"y":0.72673733831596232,"w":0.09670782089233397,"x":0.088477365171116942,"h":0.01454173156594496,"c":1,"t":"PART 3"},{"t":"HAZEL:","x":0.088477366403362345,"w":0.047325102488199877,"c":1,"y":0.75436046499093379,"h":0.010174418787512463},{"t":"тOM:","x":0.088362852609163295,"y":0.7701140700667759,"h":0.0091904644690918857,"c":1,"w":0.035208450953165688},{"t":"HAZEL:","x":0.088477366718863026,"w":0.047325102488199877,"y":0.78343023236496456,"h":0.010174418787512574,"c":1},{"y":0.81256710485675998,"x":0.088000980737104662,"h":0.0095870621212801321,"w":0.03582326253255208,"t":"TOM:","c":1},{"h":0.010174418787512574,"c":1,"t":"HAZEL:","x":0.088477366403362345,"y":0.84156976731651501,"w":0.047325102488199877},{"w":0.034979422887166337,"y":0.8561046512562327,"x":0.088477366514235767,"c":1,"h":0.0087209298276508251,"t":"TOM:"},{"x":0.088477366403362345,"y":0.87063953475837552,"h":0.010174418787512574,"t":"HAZEL:","c":1,"w":0.047325102488199877},{"h":0.008720930389296444,"x":0.088477366527095841,"t":"TOM:","w":0.03497942288716635,"c":1,"y":0.88517441847177625},{"t":"Tom, could I ask you for some advice, please?","x":0.17901234369233057,"c":1,"w":0.34567901611328122,"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.75290697662269213},{"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1,"y":0.76737338057479398,"w":0.39711934407552085,"t":"Yes of course, if you think I can help. What's it about?","x":0.17901234432080013},{"w":0.58449350992838545,"y":0.78077661462249426,"x":0.17895931634851442,"c":1,"h":0.0153408803142282,"t":"It's my first media studies assignment, and I'm not sure how to go about it. You"},{"x":0.1787135342784722,"w":0.20652407328287758,"y":0.79376942583977061,"c":1,"t":"must have done it last year.","h":0.018206593004637783},{"t":"Is that the one comparing the coverage of a particular story in a range of","h":0.013250883392226132,"w":0.53909464518229155,"x":0.17901234813308881,"c":1,"y":0.81095406350921573},{"t":"newspapers?","y":0.82525471195978617,"w":0.10392432530721027,"c":1,"x":0.17864324746165508,"h":0.015574849536477919},{"w":0.088891340891520204,"x":0.18086786160477861,"y":0.84021226546097283,"h":0.011235692054559765,"t":"That's right.","c":1},{"x":0.17901234604708199,"y":0.85453474698984377,"h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1,"w":0.24691357930501301,"t":"Oh yes, I really enjoyed writing it."},{"c":1,"x":0.17901234102424732,"y":0.86918604640354691,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"So what sort of things do I need to compare?","w":0.33539095560709631},{"w":0.60709457397460942,"c":1,"y":0.88224741104653859,"h":0.01590306739223013,"t":"Well, there are several things. For example, there's the question of which page of","x":0.17897690974178715},{"t":"the newspaper the item appears on.","x":0.17901235530377921,"y":0.89811542981138581,"w":0.27160491943359377,"c":1,"h":0.011778563015312105},{"c":1,"w":0.034979422887166378,"t":"Q21","x":0.81481481520893739,"y":0.8837209300917287,"h":0.011627907185728703},{"x":0.83539094688975013,"y":0.91715116262953922,"w":0.034979422887166378,"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1,"t":"109"}]}